       <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\".github/assets/repo-of-the-day-dark.svg\">\n29:       <img alt=\"🏆 #1 Repository of the Day on GitHub Trending\" src=\".github/assets/repo-of-the-day-light.svg\" height=\"60\">\n30:     </picture>\n31:   </a>\n32: </p>\n33: \n34: <p align=\"center\"><strong>Follow The Build</strong></p>\n35: \n36: <p align=\"center\">\n37:   <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@OpenMontage\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/YouTube-%40OpenMontage-FF0000?style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a>\n38:   <a href=\"https://x.com/calesthioailabs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/X-%40calesthioailabs-111111?style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" alt=\"X\"></a>\n39:   <a href=\"https://github.com/calesthio/OpenMontage/discussions\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Community-GitHub%20Discussions-0b1220?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub Discussions\"></a>\n40: </p>\n41: \n42: ## Sponsors\n43: \n44: > Want to support OpenMontage? [Sponsor the project](https://github.com/sponsors/calesthio).\n45: \n46: <details open>\n47: <summary>Click to collapse</summary>\n48: \n49: <table>\n50: <tr>\n51: <td width=\"180\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://bloome.im/login?ref=calesthio\"><img src=\"assets/sponsors/bloome.png\" alt=\"Bloome\" width=\"150\"></a></td>\n52: <td><strong>Bloome</strong> lets multiple AI agents (Claude, ChatGPT, DeepSeek, and more) collaborate in one conversation for agentic video pipelines. It has zero setup, runs in the cloud, works on web and mobile, and lets you share a configured agent with your whole team. <strong><a href=\"https://bloome.im/login?ref=calesthio\">Try Bloome</a></strong>.</td>\n53: </tr>\n54: <tr>\n55: <td width=\"180\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.atlascloud.ai/coding-plan\"><img src=\"assets/sponsors/atlas-cloud.png\" alt=\"Atlas Cloud\" width=\"150\"></a></td>\n56: <td><strong>Atlas Cloud</strong> is